===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gmw-pro|*standan}}, from {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*standaną}}, from {{der|ang|ine-pro|*steh₂-}}. 

Cognate with {{cog|ofs|stonda}}, {{cog|osx|standan}}, {{cog|goh|stantan}}, {{cog|non|standa}}, {{cog|got|𐍃𐍄𐌰𐌽𐌳𐌰𐌽}}. The Germanic source is cognate with {{cog|la|stare}} and {{cog|grc|ἵστημι}}.

